class:: SinOsc
summary:: Interpolating sine wavetable oscillator.
related:: Classes/Osc, Classes/FSinOsc, Classes/SinOscFB, Classes/PMOsc, Classes/Klang
categories::  UGens>Generators>Deterministic

Description::
SinOsc is a sine wave oscillator that uses wavetable lookup with linear interpolation. It is efficient and supports both frequency and phase modulation at audio rate.
Under the hood, SinOsc uses the same mechanism as Osc, but with a fixed sine wavetable of 8192 samples. This design allows for accurate, smooth sine wave generation with modulation capabilities.

